      "target": "Prove or disprove: there exists a finite simple undirected graph G such that (i) G contains no K6 subgraph, (ii) G has no induced odd cycle of length at least 5, and (iii) every red/blue coloring of E(G) contains a triangle whose three edges all have the same color. The parenthetical K4-free follow-up in the source is not part of this target.",
      "title": "Restricted induced Ramsey witness for monochromatic triangles"
    },
