              "excerpt": "An unsplittable b-transshipment is a b-transshipment together with a path\ndecomposition consisting of source–sink paths only, and with at most one path for each\nsource–sink pair.",
              "excerpt_sha256": "e576372592deb9d17daeca7de74b78faf8130dafcd0e285dae949d4c74691c40",
