              "label": "Open-status paragraph",
              "page": 16,
              "purpose": "status",
              "section": "Conclusion and open problems"
            },
            {
              "excerpt": "Conjecture 12. Given a b-transshipment x, one can efficiently compute an unsplittable\nb-transshipment y such that\n\nx_a − d_max ≤ y_a ≤ x_a + d_max for all a ∈ A.",
